OL,3,GNEWSASuspended ferry causes problems
OL,4,Afor sports clubs
OL,5,
OL,6,FSports clubs have said the suspension
OL,7,Fof a passenger ferry service between
OL,8,FJersey and Guernsey has "caused
OL,9,Fproblems".
OL,11,FIslands Unlimited suspended its service
OL,12,Funtil 10 September following a "major
OL,13,Ffailure" to the MV San Pawl's starboard
OL,14,Fmain engine.
OL,16,FGuernsey Cricket said it has had to
OL,17,Fcharter boats to Jersey in order to
OL,18,Fcompete in upcoming matches.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
