OL,3,GNEWSASuspended ferry causes problems
OL,4,Afor sports clubs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe club's chief operating officer
OL,7,FRichard Headington said it was
OL,8,F"dependent on the ferry" and had to
OL,9,Fspent a "significant amount of extra
OL,10,Fmoney" to cover the charter costs.
